{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/contracts.test.ts",
    "title": "Batch 2 提议、评估与纠正合同测试",
    "summary": "验证提议处理链的严格数据边界：提议不等于已应用状态，更新必须携带并发版本，提议、核验和纠正分别使用受约束的批次信封。",
    "category": "tests",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "proposal-boundary",
        "title": "提议不是已应用事实",
        "body": "该测试把文档中的 Proposal v1 示例作为跨文档与代码合同夹具，确认它能被严格 schema 接受，同时明确提议对象本身不含 `state`，因此“模型提出任务”不能被解释为任务已经落地。[[c1]] 对对象添加未知的 `applied` 字段会失败，修改 kind 而不匹配对应 body 也会失败；update 操作若没有目标的预期版本同样被拒绝。[[c2]] 这些断言共同约束了结构一致性与 CAS 并发保护，避免松散模型输出绕过应用层决策。"
      },
      {
        "key": "batch-envelopes",
        "title": "分工信封与未覆盖行为",
        "body": "后续流程通过三个独立信封表达职责：ProposalBatch 记录提取角色的观察、提议和弃权；AssessmentBatch 由核验角色按提议摘要给出引文资产与语义结论；CorrectionProposal 则绑定待纠正对象、预期版本、作用域、替换内容、证据和来源。[[c3]] 测试证明这些示例可以解析并保留关键字段，但没有执行提议应用、CAS 冲突、权限校验或纠正覆盖后的状态迁移；也未系统枚举每种 proposal kind、verdict、reason code 和非法嵌套字段。因此它验证合同形状，不证明完整业务工作流或独立核验质量。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "Proposal 示例与未应用语义",
        "reason": "支持文档夹具可解析且 Proposal 不携带应用状态的结论。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/contracts.test.ts",
          "startLine": 10,
          "endLine": 20
        },
        "quote": "const proposalFixture = JSON.parse(\n  readFileSync(\"docs/implementation/batch2/examples/proposal.json\", \"utf8\"),\n);\n\ndescribe(\"Batch 2 strict contracts\", () => {\n  it(\"accepts the documented Proposal v1 fixture without treating it as applied\", () => {\n    const proposal = proposalSchema.parse(proposalFixture);\n    expe"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "严格字段、Body 与 CAS 约束",
        "reason": "支持未知字段、种类与正文不匹配、更新缺失预期版本均被拒绝。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/contracts.test.ts",
          "startLine": 22,
          "endLine": 40
        },
        "quote": "  it(\"rejects unknown fields, mismatched bodies and updates without CAS versions\", () => {\n    expect(() =>\n      proposalSchema.parse({ ...proposalFixture, applied: true }),\n    ).toThrow();\n    expect(() =>\n      proposalSchema.parse({\n        ...proposalFixture,\n        kind: \"claim\",\n      }),\n    ).toThrow();\n    "
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "批次评估与纠正信封",
        "reason": "支持 ProposalBatch、AssessmentBatch 和 CorrectionProposal 的职责与关键字段说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/contracts.test.ts",
          "startLine": 42,
          "endLine": 89
        },
        "quote": "  it(\"defines strict ProposalBatch, AssessmentBatch and CorrectionProposal envelopes\", () => {\n    const batch = proposalBatchSchema.parse({\n      schema_version: 1,\n      job_id: \"job-1\",\n      role_id: \"extractor@1\",\n      observations: [],\n      proposals: [proposalFixture],\n      abstentions: [],\n    });\n    expect"
      }
    ],
    "questions": []
